      "body": "TBH, this is a pretty extreme corner case.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T03:45:36Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60950#issuecomment-6093435745",
      "id": 6093435745,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-10T03:45:36Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "ZJY0516"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "> TBH, this is a pretty extreme corner case.\r\n\r\nAgreed, but this 2-line fix is low-risk and has zero impact on default behavior. It simply prevents a Bailing V3 capture crash by aligning the breakable path with the default piecewise path.\r\n\r\nWe did a very similar alignment for Mamba models in https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57881.\r\n\r\nHappy to adjust if you prefer another approach!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T03:55:01Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60950#issuecomment-6093504013",
      "id": 6093504013,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-10T03:55:01Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "zhenwei-intel"
      }
    }
